    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="15">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Iudex">Iudex</ref> 15</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">In dóme ne sceal man æniges mannes mæð sceawian, ac þa spæce.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">In (matters of) judgement, one should not take a man’s rank into consideration.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Iustum iudicium est, ubi non persona, sed opera considerantur.</ab>
      </div>
